nd can handle most work in making one without help from others. She has already sold an animation to a famous publishing company and made enough of a fortune for the rest of her life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has feelings for Jin, and acts very open to express her feelings, but Jin turns a blind eye to this and dates many other girls, which can make her very depressed. Even at one point, Jin decided to date Misaki's older sister, Fuuka, instead of Misaki."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c25972"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/32d5bf33cad2a354e0ac784f01f2b2ead776344d82502fdbd067ce2bbff5c0a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/9524015e5473534af8c6ce87f87ff6365ff5f2b80b6da706467918104137718e.webp","width":199,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高森 奈津美","creatorId":"vndb:s979","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s979","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s979","name":"高森 奈津美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:49224","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c25973","characterName":"中野 乙羽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c25973"},"originalCharacterName":"中野 乙羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nakano is a first year high school student in Suimei University of the Arts. She is a classmate of Daichi Miyahara."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is 